{
  "comment": [
    "The requests the differential harness replays against FerroTERM and against",
    "Snowstorm over the same licensed edition. Every entry carries SNOMED CT",
    "identifiers and nothing else: no term, no definition, no hierarchy, so this",
    "file distributes no SNOMED CT content. The concepts are the International",
    "Edition's most stable top-level anchors, chosen so the sample survives a",
    "release cycle. The inactive concept is stable by construction: an",
    "inactive concept is never reactivated.",
    "",
    "`compare` names the projection the harness diffs, because the two servers",
    "answer the same question in different shapes. The projections are defined in",
    "scripts/checks/differential.sh."
  ],
  "system": "http://snomed.info/sct",
  "requests": [
